Roadster is an unofficial theme for Omarchy.

It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to Tesla, Inc. or SpaceX.
"Tesla", "Roadster", and "Ano White" are used here as references to the car
the palette and wallpapers come from.

The photographs in backgrounds/ were published by Tesla on 15–16 October 2026
and reposted in the threads linked from the README. They are included here as
desktop wallpapers. Tesla retains the photographs. The MIT license covers the
theme files only, not those images.
